# Jak 1: where each settings row sits for the pointer (LIST-0.1.3 item 1, calibration for jak1_ptr_settings.sim). Start
# opens the title menu, the stick down twice is Options, A opens it; a picture, then A opens its first row (Game
# Options): the right hand sweeps from 30 degrees up to -20 down, a picture each 5 degrees (JAKVR_POINTER_TRACE=1 logs
# the dot and the row under it). Then B back, the stick down to Sound Options (two rows on), A, the same sweep.
